"<strong>Inverse square.</strong> The Cs-{#} standard (its activity is fixed), no absorber, one ROI on the photopeak. Acquire {#} s live at several distances (drag the source holder or the <strong>Source to detector face, d</strong> slider), <strong>Add to table</strong> each time, and open the <strong>Distance</strong> plot. Ask Q5 before the {#} cm run.",
